    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni en e gagi m’upodho ni suru pa Manase; kum en e kayu pa Yusuf. Pi Makir ma kayu pa Manase, ma won Gilead, kum en e dhanu mir ali, ka kumeno ebedo ku Gilead ku Bacan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno gagi en e pi dong’ nyithindho pa Manase calku wat migi: mi nyithindho pa Abiezer, man mi nyithindho pa Helek, man mi nyithindho pa Asriel, man mi nyithindho pa Cekem, man mi nyithindho pa Hefer, man mi nyithindho pa Cemida: maeni gi nyithindho ma co pa Manase ma wod Yusuf calku wat migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Zelofehad, ma wod Hefer, ma wod Gilead, ma wod Makir, ma wod Manase, wote mbe, ndhu nyige re: man maeni gi nying’ nyige: Mala, man Noa, man Hogla, ku Milka, man Tirza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.1+NUM.27.2+NUM.27.3+NUM.27.4+NUM.27.5+NUM.27.6+NUM.27.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 27:1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gibino ceng’ni i wang’ Eleazar ma jalam, man i wang’ Yocuwa ma wod Nun, man i wang’ judongomawijo, giwacu kumae, Yehova ng’olo ni Musa ya emi iwa aba i kind utumegwa: ka kumeno calku lembang’ola pa Yehova emio igi aba i kind uturneggi pa weggi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man gagi m’upodho ni Manase en e ng’ete apar, umedo ng’om mi Gilead man Bacan, ma en e loka Yordan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kum nyig Manase ubedo kud aba i kind wote. Man ng’om Gilead en e piny mi dong’ wot pa Manase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kieu pa Manase gambre Acer utundo kum Mikmethath ma ni wang’ Cekem; man kieu cidho cil kum cing’ ma yor acwic ba ju m’ubedo i En-tapua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’om pa Tapua en e piny pa Manase; ento Tapua i kieu pa Manase en e piny mi nyithindho pa Efraim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kieu loro kum kulo mi Kana, yor ariwa ma piny ni kulo: adhura maeni gi piny pa Efraim i kind adhura pa Manase: man kieu pa Manase en e yor ariwa ma malu ni kulo, man kawokne en e dhu nam: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yor ariwa ma piny en e pa Efraim, man yor ariwa ma malu en e pa Manase, man nam en e kieune; man gitundo kum Acer yor ariwa ma malu, man kum Isakar yo nyangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Manase bedo ku Beth-cean kud adhurane de, ku Ibleam man adhurane de, ku dhanu mi Dor kud adhurane de, ku dhanu mi En-dor kud adhurane de, man dhanu mi Tanak kud adhurane de, ku dhanu mi Megido man adhurane de, cil ka m’utingre adek, i Isakar man i Acer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Pok 1:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento nyithindho pa Manase gicopo riemo dhanu mir adhura maeno woko ngo; ento Jukanani giceri i ng’om maeno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kinde ma nyithindho mir Israel udoko tek, nia giketho Jukanani kum tic ma jumuli ko, e giriemogi woko kot ungo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man nyithindho pa Yusuf uyero ni Yocuwa, giwacu kumae, Nedi imio ira gagi acel man makapiny acel kende ni aba, kum nwang’u an a dhanu ma dit, kum naka cil ku kawono Yehova mio mugisa ira? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yocuwa wacu igi kumae, Tek in i dhanu ma dit, idh malu kum luli, man itong’ iri giri keca i ng’om mi Juperizi man mi Jurefaim; kum ng’om gudi pa Efraim e diny hai iri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E nyithindho pa Yusuf giwacu kumae, Ng’om gudi eromowa ngo: man Jukanani ceke m’ubedo i ng’om poga gi weg magali mi nyunyu, ju ma ni i Beth-cean ku ma ni i adhurane bende, man ju ma ni i poga mi Yezrel de. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yocuwa yero ni ot pa Yusuf en e ni Efraim man ni Manase, ewacu kumae, In i dhanu ma dit, man tego peri dit; ibibedo ku gagi acel kende ngo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento ng’om gudi bibedo peri; kum kadok en e luli, ibitong’e piny, man kawokne bibedo peri; kum ibiriemo Jukanani woko, kadok gi weg magali mi nyunyu, man kadok gi tek de.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
